    "view": "<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\" role=\"document\" x-data=\"Challenge\" x-init='id = 174; max_attempts = 0; attempts = 1; ratingValue = null; ratingReview = null;'>\n  <div class=\"modal-content\">\n    <div class=\"modal-body py-4 px-4 px-sm-5\">\n\n      <div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close float-end\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n\n        <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n          <li class=\"nav-item\">\n            <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-target=\"#challenge\" @click=\"showChallenge()\">\n              Challenge\n            </button>\n          </li>\n\n          \n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n            <li class=\"nav-item\">\n              <button class=\"nav-link challenge-solves\" data-bs-target=\"#solves\" @click=\"showSolves()\">\n                  800 Solves\n              </button>\n            </li>\n            \n          \n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"tab-content\">\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"challenge\">\n            <h2 class=\"challenge-name text-center pt-3\">\n              Start Here: Sanity Check\n            </h2>\n            <h3 class=\"challenge-value text-center\">\n              10\n            </h3>\n\n\n            \n              <div class=\"challenge-tags text-center pt-2 pb-3\">\n                \n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge\">Intro</span>\n                  \n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <small class=\"challenge-attribution text-center text-muted\">\n              \n            </small>\n\n            \n            <small class=\"challenge-ratings text-center text-muted d-block\">\n              \n                \n                  <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-up\"></i> 57</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-center px-2\">\n                    \n                    (98% liked)\n                    \n                  </span>\n                  <span><i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-down\"></i> 1</span>\n                \n              \n            </small>\n            \n\n            <span class=\"challenge-desc\"><h3>Welcome to BrunnerCTF 2026</h3>\n<p>Dear interns in Brunnerne Inc.™ - before starting your internship with us, here is some important introductory information, especially if you are new to CTFs</p>\n<h3>What is a CTF?</h3>\n<p>A CTF (Capture The Flag) is a cybersecurity competition with challenges in areas like web exploitation, pwn, reverse engineering, cryptography, digital forensics, boot2root, and more.</p>\n<p>Each challenge hides a flag in the format <code>brunner{something}</code>, often in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leet\">1337</a>. Submit flags to earn points.</p>\n<h3>Onboarding</h3>\n<p>You are currently in <code>Onboarding</code> - beginner-friendly challenges worth 10-40 points each. These challenges are tagged with the actual category.</p>\n<p>If you get stuck with an <code>Onboarding</code> challenge, you can request hints on Discord via a <code>Hint</code> ticket - but always force yourself to really &quot;try harder&quot; first. No hints will be provided for other challenges.</p>\n<h3>Dynamic Scoring</h3>\n<p>All other challenges are scored <em>dynamically</em>: the more solves a challenge has, the less it is worth for everyone who has solved it. Due to this, you might see your score decrease during the CTF.</p>\n<p>Challenges start at a 1000 points and gradually decrease in score. After a specific number of solves, they reach a minimum of 100 points.</p>\n<h3>Instanced Challenges</h3>\n<p>Some challenges only have a downloadable handout file. Others require you to connect to a website or server. Most of these have a &quot;Start Challenge&quot; button that starts your team's instance of that challenge. Only your team has access to this instance.</p>\n<h3>Let's Go!</h3>\n<p>Before you move on, please read the <a href=\"/rules\">rules</a> of the CTF carefully. They contain important notes on what you're allowed to and not.</p>\n<p>Then, submit the following flag:<br />\n<code>brunner{welcome_to_your_new_unpaid_internship}</code></p>\n</span>\n\n            \n\n            \n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n              <p class=\"text-center\">\n                <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> attempts\n              </p>\n            </template>\n\n            <div class=\"row submit-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-8 col-xl-10\">\n                \n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-id\" class=\"challenge-id\" type=\"hidden\"\n                      value=\"174\"\n                  >\n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-input\" class=\"challenge-input form-control\"\n                      type=\"text\" name=\"submission\"\n                      @keyup.enter=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                      placeholder=\"Flag\" x-model=\"submission\"\n                  >\n                \n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-4 col-xl-2 mt-3 mt-sm-0 key-submit\">\n                \n                  <button\n                      id=\"challenge-submit\"\n                      class=\"challenge-submit btn btn-outline-secondary w-100 h-100\" type=\"submit\"\n                      @click.debounce.500ms=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                  >\n                    Submit\n                  </button>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n              <div class=\"row submit-row challenge-cleared-box\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 text-center\">\n                  <span class=\"challenge-cleared-badge\">&#10003; Cleared</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            \n\n            <div class=\"row notification-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <template x-if=\"response\">\n                  \n                  <div class=\"alert text-center w-100 mt-3\"\n                      :class=\"{\n                        'alert-success': response.data.status == 'correct',\n                        'alert-info': response.data.status == 'already_solved',\n                        'alert-danger': response.data.status == 'incorrect',\n                        'alert-warning': response.data.status == 'paused',\n                      }\" role=\"alert\"\n                  >\n                    <strong x-text=\"response.data.message\"></strong>\n                    <div x-show=\"(response.data.status == 'correct' || response.data.status == 'already_solved')\">\n                      <div x-show=\"getNextId()\">\n                        <button @click=\"nextChallenge()\" class=\"btn btn-info mt-3\">\n                          Next Challenge\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n\n                      \n                      <div>\n                        <button x-show=\"!share_url\" @click=\"getShareUrl()\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info mt-3\">\n                          Share\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"btn-group mt-3\" role=\"group\" x-show=\"share_url\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"copyShareUrl()\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"Copied!\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-twitter\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n\n                      \n                      <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                        <hr>\n                        <div class=\"text-center\">\n                          <p class=\"mb-2\">Rate this challenge:</p>\n                          <div class=\"rating-buttons mb-2\" x-init=\"selectedRating = ratingValue || 0;\">\n                            <button\n                              class=\"btn btn-outline-success me-2\"\n                              :class=\"{ 'active': selectedRating === 1 }\"\n                              @click=\"selectedRating = 1\"\n                            >\n                              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-up\"></i>\n                            </button>\n                            <button\n                              class=\"btn btn-outline-danger\"\n                              :class=\"{ 'active': selectedRating === -1 }\"\n                              @click=\"selectedRating = -1\"\n                            >\n                              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-down\"></i>\n                            </button>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                            <textarea \n                              class=\"form-control\" \n                              rows=\"2\" \n                              x-model=\"ratingReview\"\n                              placeholder=\"Write a review (optional)\"\n                              maxlength=\"2000\"\n                            ></textarea>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                            <button \n                              @click=\"submitRating()\"\n                              class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n                              :disabled=\"!selectedRating\"\n                            >\n                              Submit\n                            </button>\n                          </div>\n                          <div x-show=\"ratingSubmitted\" class=\"text-success mt-2\">\n                            <small>Thank you for your rating!</small>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </template>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"submissions\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Submission</th>\n                    <th>Type</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-submission-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"submission in submissions\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td x-data=\"{ truncate: true }\">\n                        <code x-text=\"truncate ? '*'.repeat(submission.provided.length) : submission.provided\"></code>\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-link p-0 pl-1\" @click=\"truncate = !truncate\">\n                          <i :class=\"truncate ? 'fas fa-eye' : 'fas fa-eye-slash'\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.type\"></td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solves\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Name</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-solves-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"solve in solves\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td>\n                        <a :href=\"solve.account_url\" x-text=\"solve.name\"></a>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"solve.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solution\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <div class=\"challenge-solution-content pt-3\">\n                  <template x-if=\"solution\">\n                    <div x-html=\"solution\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n                    </div>\n                  </template>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
  },
